\fs36 \cf0 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Figure 5 is a scatter plot of month-to-month changes in 12-month-ending overdose death rates (per million population) versus month-to-month changes in 12-month-ending overdose decedent donor (ODD) liver transplant rates (per million population), during the decline period (September 2023\'96December 2024) identified by joinpoint regression in Figure 4. A linear regression with Newey\'96West heteroscedasticity and autocorrelation consistent (HAC) standard errors is fitted to the data.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
